  "fullDescription": "Infuse your designs with bubbly 70s nostalgia, cheerful pop-art energy, and playful charm with RETRO DISPLAY! Crafted as the ultimate groovy display font, its ultra-puffy, soft-rounded letterforms feature wavy contours and fun, bulbous proportions that instantly capture attention. Made by craft artists for craft lovers, this typeface brings a joyful, vintage vibe to any creative layout.\n\nPerfect for retro sticker pack designs, groovy apparel prints, kids’ party invitations, colorful product packaging, summer event posters, social media quote graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette vinyl projects, RETRO DISPLAY adds a splash of fun-loving nostalgia to every word!",
